      "items": [
        "Lord William Bentinck became the first Governor-General of India through the Charter Act of 1833.",
        "Lord Canning served as both the last Governor-General under company rule and the first Viceroy of India in 1858.",
        "Womesh Chandra Bonnerjee presided over the first INC session at Bombay in December 1885, attended by 72 delegates."
